ede interpretarse de manera distinta según el ambiente, la jerarquía o el momento en que se emite."}},{"type":"text","name":"Propósitos explícitos o implícitos que orientan el acto comunicativo. Detrás de cada mensaje existe una finalidad (informar, persuadir, coordinar, motivar o resolver un desacuerdo) que condiciona la forma, el tono y el canal seleccionados para establecer e","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}]}},"id":"029a4e19-6dcc-43b0-ad6d-6b975b88961d","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-8363,"ty":-10845},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24,"paragraphAlign":"center"}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":276},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":39,"x":-133.6696319580078}],[{"y":39,"from":39,"to":77,"x":-132.93089294433594}],[{"y":63,"from":77,"to":114,"x":-131.77369689941406}],[{"y":87,"from":114,"to":155,"x":-137.55337524414062}],[{"y":111,"from":155,"to":185,"x":-107.88418579101562}],[{"y":135,"from":185,"to":225,"x":-134.43572998046875}],[{"y":159,"from":225,"to":258,"x":-116.99886322021484}],[{"y":183,"from":258,"to":270,"x":-44.708282470703125}]]}],"rawText":"Propósitos explícitos o implícitos que orientan el acto comunicativo. Detrás de cada mensaje existe una finalidad (informar, persuadir, coordinar, motivar o resolver un desacuerdo) que condiciona la forma, el tono y el canal seleccionados para establecer el intercambio."}},{"type":"text","name":"Respuestas o reacciones del receptor ante el mensaje recibido, que facilitan verificar si la comunicación fue efectiva. Pueden manifestarse de forma verbal, gestual o comportamental y convierten el proceso en un intercambio bidireccional que posibilita la ","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyles":[{"length":1094,"linkId":"","fontFamily":"Roboto","fontStyle":"Regular","postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","fontSize":16,"charSpacing":2.5,"underline":false,"textTransform":"none","textScript":"none","fill":{"value":4279379519},"strikethrough":false,"hyperlinkUrl":""}]}},"id":"8da4d60d-ee0b-46eb-a6ff-9c81a52aa741","transform":{"a":1,"b":0,"c":0,"d":1,"tx":-8005,"ty":-10845},"style":{"fill":{"type":"solid","color":{"mode":"RGB","value":{"r":18,"g":38,"b":63}}},"font":{"postscriptName":"Roboto-Regular","family":"Roboto","style":"Regular","size":16},"textAttributes":{"letterSpacing":2.5,"lineHeight":24,"paragraphAlign":"center"}},"text":{"frame":{"type":"autoHeight","width":276},"paragraphs":[{"lines":[[{"y":15,"from":0,"to":37,"x":-133.985107421875}],[{"y":39,"from":37,"to":77,"x":-134.5372772216797}],[{"y":63,"from":77,"to":110,"x":-110.86559295654297}],[{"y":87,"from":110,"to":143,"x":-119.14730072021484}],[{"y":111,"from":143,"to":167,"x":-81.64311218261719}],[{"y":135,"from":167,"to":198,"x":-113.1229248046875}],[{"y":159,"from":198,"to":224,"x":-95.07373046875}],[{"y":183,"from":224,"to":256,"x":-103.76403045654297}],[{"y":207,"from":256,"to":287,"x":-111.80652618408203}]]}],"rawText":"Respuestas o reacciones del receptor ante el mensaje recibido, que facilitan verificar si la comunicación fue efectiva. Pueden manifestarse de forma verbal, gestual o comportamental y convierten el proceso en un intercambio bidireccional que posibilita la comprensión y el ajuste mutuo. "}},{"type":"text","name":"Contextos","meta":{"ux":{"nameL10N":"SHAPE_GROUP","constraintWidth":true,"constraintHeight":true,"singleTextObject":true,"rangedStyl